Agent memory allows an agent to retain useful information across interactions or within a task.

Two major concepts:

Short-term memory

Current conversation/task.

User: My name is Sravya.
Agent: Nice to meet you.
User: What is my name?
Agent: Sravya.
Long-term memory

Information retained for future interactions.

Example:

User preference:
Python
Generative AI
RAG

The system can retrieve relevant memories later.

Memory architecture
Conversation
 ↓
Memory
 ↓
Retrieve relevant information
 ↓
Agent
